  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h3><strong>• About our brand and products:</strong></h3><p>Villenel Fragrances brings high-quality Thai niche perfumes to the EU market — exclusive scents not available elsewhere in Europe. Our selection is carefully curated to offer premium, modern, and unique fragrance experiences.</p><hr><h3><strong>• What makes us different:</strong></h3><p>We offer exclusive fragrances, distinctive Thai perfume artistry, and EU-wide delivery. Our focus is on premium quality, unique compositions, and a smooth, customer-focused shopping experience.</p><hr><h3><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong></h3><p>Affiliates earn commissions on all purchases made through their personal link. Any orders placed within the cookie period are automatically tracked and rewarded.</p><hr><h3><strong>• How to promote us:</strong></h3><p>We recommend authentic content such as unboxings, first impressions, reviews, and scent recommendations. Share your link and code on Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, or your blog for the best results.</p><hr><h3><strong>• Other information:</strong></h3><p>We provide ready-to-use marketing materials, campaign updates, and continuous support. Joining our affiliate program is simple and built for long-term, mutually beneficial collaboration.</p></div></div>",
